# airdrop scripts
# compressed-mint-config.json and airdrop-recipients.json are committed as a
# working example so the app builds in a fresh checkout; airdrop:setup
# overwrites them with real values when a user runs the actual setup flow.
# Neither file ever contains RPC_ENDPOINT (it holds your Helius api-key) - that
# stays in .env.local only and is read from process.env at build time instead.
scripts/test-wallets.json
